<title>POLAND: Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three stocks rose, four fell and eight were flat in 3.8-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The remaining six stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 1.3 percent to 160 zlotys in a 34.4-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
